# Copy this file to .env and put your own key after the = sign. The .env file is never committed.
# A free key: https://data.trafikverket.se  ->  Kom igång -> Registrera, then Skapa nyckel.
# The key is built into the page when it runs or is packed (npm run dev, npm run build), so never put the
# packed folder (dist/) on a public server.
VITE_TRV_KEY=
